               <p xml:id="idm128">The dating is taken from the 1887 edition of the work. This sonata was the first attempt of the twenty-two-year old composer to write a violin sonata. It was highly appreciated by Robert Schumann and Louis Spohr, who performed it together with his wife, the pianist Marianne Spohr.</p>
